            "raw_output": "--- checkpoint fil_data ---\n\ufeffstart_time,hemisphere,,,,,,\r\n2012-03-05T04:00:05,North,,,,,,\r\n2012-03-07T00:24:06,North,,,,,,\r\n2012-03-07T01:30:06,North,,,,,,\r\n2012-03-13T17:36:05,North,,,,,,\r\n2012-04-23T18:24:05,North,,,,,,\r\n2012-06-14T14:12:07,South,,,,,,\r\n2012-07-12T16:48:05,South,,,,,,\r\n2012-09-28T0:12:05,North,,,,,,\r\n2012-03-15T07:12:05,North,,,,,,\r\n2013-07-11T15:12:10,South,,,,,,\r\n2015-03-15T01:48:05,South,,,,,,\r\n,,,,,,,\r\n,,,,,,,\r\n,,,,,,,\r\n,,,,,,,--- diff between checkpoint and current ---\n1,16c1,12\n< \ufeffstart_time,hemisphere,,,,,,\r\n< 2012-03-05T04:00:05,North,,,,,,\r\n< 2012-03-07T00:24:06,North,,,,,,\r\n< 2012-03-07T01:30:06,North,,,,,,\r\n< 2012-03-13T17:36:05,North,,,,,,\r\n< 2012-04-23T18:24:05,North,,,,,,\r\n< 2012-06-14T14:12:07,South,,,,,,\r\n< 2012-07-12T16:48:05,South,,,,,,\r\n< 2012-09-28T0:12:05,North,,,,,,\r\n< 2012-03-15T07:12:05,North,,,,,,\r\n< 2013-07-11T15:12:10,South,,,,,,\r\n< 2015-03-15T01:48:05,South,,,,,,\r\n< ,,,,,,,\r\n< ,,,,,,,\r\n< ,,,,,,,\r\n< ,,,,,,,\n\\ No newline at end of file\n---\n> \ufeffstart_time,hemisphere\r\n> 2012-03-05T04:00:05,1\r\n> 2012-03-07T00:24:06,1\r\n> 2012-03-07T01:30:06,1\r\n> 2012-03-13T17:36:05,1\r\n> 2012-04-23T18:24:05,1\r\n> 2012-06-14T14:12:07,0\r\n> 2012-07-12T16:48:05,0\r\n> 2012-09-28T00:12:05,1\r\n> 2012-03-15T07:12:05,1\r\n> 2013-07-11T15:12:10,0\r\n> 2015-03-15T01:48:05,0\n\\ No newline at end of file\n--- any other csv/data files with chirality? ---\n/home/jovyan/surya_workshop/downstream_apps/filament_kyle/untitled1.chat\n/home/jovyan/surya_workshop/downstream_apps/filament_kyle/brainstorming.chat\n/home/jovyan/surya_workshop/downstream_apps/filament_kyle/brainstorming.chat\n/home/jovyan/surya_workshop/downstream_apps/filament_kyle/untitled1.chat"
