      "body": "This confirms the plan from your earlier brainstorming: since Martin's Rule already predicts chirality from hemisphere at ~90% accuracy, the right baseline is the hemisphere-based majority-class rule itself (not a trained model, which would just overfit on N=45). Let me check the existing baseline notebook pattern and current app files before building it.",
