      "type": "msg",
      "body": "I want the baseline to be a coin-flip to start. I know it's not very impressive, but I specifically have events that might be exceptions to Martin's Rule, so it may already suffer in comparison from that higher percentage baseline and I'll compare with coin-flip instead. ",
      "id": "48b7a437-5ae6-4184-a4f6-cd6ee0915227",
