            "raw_output": "downstream_apps/filament_kyle/configs.py:33:    \"\"\"DataConfig plus the filament-catalog alignment settings used by ``FilamentDataset``.\ndownstream_apps/filament_kyle/configs.py:54:load_filament_config = partial(load_config, data_cls=FilamentDataConfig)\ndownstream_apps/filament_kyle/configs.py:59:    \"load_filament_config\",\ndownstream_apps/filament_kyle/datasets/filament_dataset.py:7:class FilamentDataset(HelioNetCDFDataset):\ndownstream_apps/filament_kyle/datasets/filament_dataset.py:68:            raise ValueError(\"filament_index_path must be provided for FilamentDataset\")\ndownstream_apps/filament_kyle/0_dataset_dataloader_template.ipynb:75:      \"  scalers     : /home/jovyan/surya_workshop/downstream_apps/filament_kyle/assets/scalers.yaml\\n\"\ndownstream_apps/filament_kyle/0_dataset_dataloader_template.ipynb:80:    \"# The config is the single source of truth. load_filament_config() parses it into a typed\\n\",\ndownstream_apps/filament_kyle/0_dataset_dataloader_template.ipynb:87:    \"from downstream_apps.filament_kyle.configs import load_filament_config\\n\",\ndownstream_apps/filament_kyle/0_dataset_dataloader_template.ipynb:89:    \"cfg = load_filament_config(\\\"./configs/config_script.yaml\\\")\\n\",\ndownstream_apps/filament_kyle/0_dataset_dataloader_template.ipynb:156:    \"from downstream_apps.filament_kyle.datasets.filament_dataset import FilamentDataset\"\ndownstream_apps/filament_kyle/0_dataset_dataloader_template.ipynb:184:    \"train_dataset = FilamentDataset(\\n\",\ndownstream_apps/filament_kyle/0_dataset_dataloader_template.ipynb:468:    \"train_dataset = FilamentDataset(\\n\",\nShell cwd was reset to /home/jovyan/surya_workshop/downstream_apps/filament_kyle",
