      "body": "I want to debug the 1_baseline notebook, I have this error: File ~/surya_workshop/downstream_apps/filament_kyle/../../workshop_infrastructure/datasets/builders.py:136, in build_helio_dataloaders(cfg, dataset_cls, scalers, num_workers, seed, **task_kwargs)\n    110 def build_helio_dataloaders(\n    111     cfg,\n    112     dataset_cls: Type[Dataset],\n   (...)\n    116     **task_kwargs,\n    117 ) -> Tuple[DataLoader, DataLoader]:\n    118     \"\"\"Build the train and validation DataLoaders described by ``cfg``.\n    119 \n    120     Args:\n   (...)\n    134         ``(train_loader, val_loader)``. Only the training loader shuffles.\n    135     \"\"\"\n--> 136     train_dataset, val_dataset = build_helio_datasets(\n    137         cfg, dataset_cls, scalers=scalers, **task_kwargs\n    138     )\n    140     workers = cfg.num_workers if num_workers is None else num_workers\n    141     base_seed = cfg.seed if seed is None else seed\n\nFile ~/surya_workshop/downstream_apps/filament_kyle/../../workshop_infrastructure/datasets/builders.py:106, in build_helio_datasets(cfg, dataset_cls, scalers, **task_kwargs)\n    103 common = {**_base_dataset_kwargs(cfg, scalers), **task_kwargs}\n    105 train_dataset = dataset_cls(index_path=cfg.data.train_data_path, phase=\"train\", **common)\n--> 106 val_dataset = dataset_cls(index_path=cfg.data.valid_data_path, phase=\"val\", **common)\n    107 return train_dataset, val_dataset\n\nFile ~/surya_workshop/downstream_apps/filament_kyle/../../downstream_apps/filament_kyle/datasets/filament_dataset.py:112, in FilamentDataset.__init__(self, return_surya_stack, max_number_of_samples, label_transform, filament_index_path, ds_time_column, ds_time_tolerance, ds_match_direction, **kwargs)\n    107     self.df_valid_indices = self.df_valid_indices.loc[\n    108         self.df_valid_indices[\"index_delta\"] <= pd.Timedelta(ds_time_tolerance),\n    109         :,\n    110     ]\n    111     if len(self.df_valid_indices) == 0:\n--