            "raw_output": "284:    def __init__(self, num_channels, num_mask_aia_channels, phase, drop_hmi_probability):\n327:    Index format (CSV with columns: timestep, path, present):\n329:        timestep                    path                                present\n393:            validity check \u2014 only input-frame timestamps need to be present.\n396:    def __init__(\n489:        self.index = self.index[self.index[\"present\"] == 1]\n496:        self.valid_indices = self._filter_valid_indices()\n497:        self.adjusted_length = len(self.valid_indices)\n526:    def _filter_valid_indices(self) -> list:\n527:        \"\"\"Return the list of reference timesteps for which all required offsets are present.\n615:        reference_timestep = self.valid_indices[idx]\nShell cwd was reset to /home/jovyan/surya_workshop/downstream_apps/filament_kyle",
