      "id": "efb2ff45-e1f6-43ca-a81e-2800d4ffb8c0",
      "body": "The notebook doesn't run the cells at the end, it's still stuck on errors from the template cells. How can I circumvent this? Should I just comment out the bits that are not helpful for this application?",
      "metadata": {
