      "body": "The kernel switch worked \u2014 this cell just ran under `/home/jovyan/envs/surya_ws/bin/python` (execution_count reset to 1, confirming a fresh kernel). The earlier torch errors are now stale. Let me re-run the whole notebook and remove the diagnostic cell.",
